# SharePoint (detect-on — Classic / Modern ASPX / SPFx)

**Detect**: SPFx = `@microsoft/sp-*` or `src/webparts/`/`src/extensions/`/`*.sppkg`. Classic = `*.master` / `_layouts` / `Style Library` / JSOM·`SP.js` / CEWP·SEWP + `.aspx`. Modern ASPX = site/application `.aspx` without SPFx package (or user confirmed). signal <2 or mixed → Clarify-first.
**SEO**: intranet/admin → Skip. SEO standards only for public-facing.

### Classic site
- Surface `fullstack`/`frontend`. Do not edit master page / `_layouts` / core system files directly — repo/custom assets (`Style Library`, Site Assets) only.
- Script = `SP.SOD` / `ExecuteOrDelayUntilScriptLoaded`; mind MDS. Do not remove SharePoint chrome selectors from DOM.
- Data = REST `/_api` or JSOM — no string-concat CAML/SQL. Write = FormDigest / `X-RequestDigest`.
- AuthZ = site/list permissions + item-level; AuthN alone not enough (prevent IDOR).
- XSS = CEWP/SEWP/raw HTML escape·sanitize. New inline script only per repo pattern. UI = existing CSS; no invented Tailwind/SPA router.

### Modern ASPX (non-SPFx pages)
- Surface `frontend`/`fullstack`. No classic master-page assumptions — follow Modern chrome/page lifecycle.
- Custom = Site Assets/CDN approved script·CSS; avoid Script Editor / arbitrary inject (tenant policy).
- Data = REST `/_api` + digest; Graph uses repo auth pattern. No hardcoded secrets/tenant IDs.
- DOM = durable selectors; avoid brittle queries due to Modern UI re-render. Use Fluent/repo tokens if present.
- A11y = keyboard/focus/name; skip web SEO (intranet) unless public.

### SPFx (`@microsoft/sp-*`)
- Surface `frontend`/`fullstack`. Skip generic React(web) rules — SPFx host lifecycle + repo UI. **This repo page UI** = classic clone (`classic-visual-parity`); do not target Fluent density/theme for visual parity. version/React per repo `package.json`.
- Paths = `src/webparts/`, `src/extensions/`, `sharepoint/assets/` (`elements.xml`, `ClientSideInstance.xml`). Do not break Property Pane + packaging `.sppkg` pattern.
- Data = SPHttpClient / PnPjs (if present) — no raw concat. Check permissions/AuthZ at list·item level.
- Styling = `*.module.scss`. **This repo page UI** = classic `DBS-FFW-classicsite/2025/style.css` exact values (`classic-visual-parity`) — do not replace with Fluent/theme tokens. `@media` = classic breakpoint px (no Fluent-only 480). Do not touch global CSS chrome (host-gap body paint only — documented exception). `gulp bundle`/`gulp serve`.
- Test = Testing Gate (`gulp test` / Manual workbench) + **visual vs classic** (`classic-visual-parity`). Application Customizer ≠ Web Part — use relevant skill/path only.
- Comments = English only (`00`); rewrite non-English on edit
